@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:办理与登记退款</u>\n<u>控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:费用申请</u>" as Request
participant "<u>:患者资金</u>" as Funds
participant "<u>:患者付款</u>" as Payment
participant "<u>:退款办理</u>" as Refund
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-26办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-26办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Request : 提供批准范围(同意版本及剩余额度)
activate Request
Request --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Request
K -> Funds : 开始退款办理(原付款、批准依据、拟退额)
activate Funds
Funds -> Payment : 核对来源可退额(分配、抵扣、已退和占用)
activate Payment
Payment --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Payment
Funds -> Refund : 建立额度占用(唯一办理依据、拟退额)
activate Refund
Refund --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Refund
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A0 -> B0 : 提交线下实际退款结果
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-26办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Funds : 确认实际退款(原办理依据、实际结果及凭据)
activate Funds
Funds -> Refund : 核实办理结果(渠道交易及实际额)
activate Refund
Refund --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Refund
Funds -> Funds : 核算退款后余额(只计一次有效流出)
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Refund
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
